test miss_outside ... ok            # 矩形外 → None
test topmost_z_wins ... ok          # 同点多矩形取 z 最大
test letterbox_offset ... ok        # 非 9:16 窗口 pillarbox offset 命中正确
test result: ok. 4 passed; 0 failed
```

